# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DUWS_T — Arma 3 mission repo
#
# We version-control the UNPACKED mission source. Packed .pbo files are build
# output (repacked from the source with PBO Manager) and are not tracked.
# See README.md for the unpack/repack workflow and the required tool.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Arma build artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Packed / binarized missions and addons — rebuildable from the unpacked source.
*.pbo
*.ebo
# Binarize + editor leftovers.
texHeaders.bin
*.bak

# ── Arma runtime logs & crash dumps ──────────────────────────────────────────
*.rpt
*.bidmp
*.mdmp

# ── Vendored tooling (see README.md) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Third-party Windows tool for unpacking/repacking the .pbo. Not project source,
# and the Windows binaries won't run in the Linux devcontainer — each environment
# supplies its own copy at this path.
# https://github.com/winseros/pboman3
/tools/PBO Manager/
# SQF VM for the unit tests (fetched by tests/get_sqfvm.sh); per-environment binary.
/tools/sqfvm
/tools/sqfvm.exe

# ── Secrets & local env ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local

# ── Claude Code (keep shared agents/skills; drop per-user overrides) ──────────
.claude/settings.local.json

# ── Editor / IDE ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.sublime-workspace

# ── OS cruft ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# macOS
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
# Windows
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk
# Linux
.directory
.Trash-*
